{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/egglets_artz.gif?t=1749735162\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dear Residents of Eggon,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We thank you for your continued support through silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Given the exceptional circumstances currently facing Eggon, you have been selected to assist us in carrying out critical community operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Eggon Committee hereby extends an official appointment:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/store_bag.gif?t=1749735162\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Position Title:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Community Management Enforcement Officer of Eggon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Temporary-Permanent Appointment)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/egglets_rednewspaper.gif?t=1749735162\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mission Duties:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Receive opaque instructions from higher authorities and carry out daily tasks</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maintain basic order, health, and psychological stability of residents</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordinate distribution of supplies and enforce spatial restrictions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage public opinion flow and prevent rumor spread</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When necessary, make decisions in the best interest of Eggon as a whole</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/egglets_artist.gif?t=1749735162\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your area of responsibility includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Units 01 to 05 \u2014 five core residents, each with a distinct personality and behavior pattern.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/egglets_roomswtich.gif?t=1749735162\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtime: ~2 hours. Multiple endings await your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simply focus on your assigned duties \u2014 we have full confidence in your capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 Eggon Committee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stardate 7024<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/store_flag.gif?t=1749735162\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3788900?t=1749735162","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3788900?t=1749735162","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/8d2d086b585ce178963ff044e819cdb7cec8e8a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749735162","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/8d2d086b585ce178963ff044e819cdb7cec8e8a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749735162","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3806290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p 